  m_text: "<b>HOW TO PLAY MALAJONG:</b>\n\n\u2022 Select tiles to form valid Mahjong
    Combos (Pair, Chow, Pong, Kong).\n\u2022 Pure Hand (all matching suits) grants
    huge Fu & Fan bonuses!\n\u2022 Beat Round Target Scores to earn Yuan and buy
    powerful Spirits in the Shop."
